---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
Work with workspaces.

USAGE
  holst workspace <command> [flags]

GENERAL COMMANDS
  ls:          List your workspaces or the ones you can join
  create:      Create a workspace

TARGETED COMMANDS
  show:        Show a workspace and the parts asked for
  rename:      Rename a workspace for all its members
  log:         Show the workspace event log

ARGUMENTS
  A workspace can be given as its id or part of its name.
  Left out, it is your only workspace.

EXAMPLES
  $ holst ws ls
  $ holst ws show easy --with members,activity
